#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:165 3fb9d4940fdf41b8933179f9f5e7cf08
msgid "**ExperimentalDesignScorer** (Type: AgenticTool)"
msgstr "**ExperimentalDesignScorer**（类型：AgenticTool）"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:167 c5280664a0b2462dbd5286acf22847ff
msgid ""
"Assesses a proposed experimental design by assigning scores and "
"structured feedback on hypothesis..."
msgstr "通过对假设进行评分和结构化反馈，评估所提议的实验设计..."

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst 26e3c39067b245b0a7f90beda9c6cf47
msgid "ExperimentalDesignScorer tool specification"
msgstr "ExperimentalDesignScorer 工具规格说明"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:173 c6064aa7cf304c4ca9ef686496598ae4
msgid "**Name**: ``ExperimentalDesignScorer``"
msgstr "**名称**：``ExperimentalDesignScorer``"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:175 3e0361bcbccc47098680d3c215236dc3
msgid ""
"**Description**: Assesses a proposed experimental design by assigning "
"scores and structured feedback on hypothesis clarity, variable "
"definitions, sample size, controls, randomization, measurement methods, "
"statistical analysis, bias mitigation, ethical considerations, and "
"overall feasibility."
msgstr "**描述**：通过对假设清晰度、变量定义、样本量、对照组、随机化、测量方法、统计分析、偏差控制、伦理考量及整体可行性进行评分和结构化反馈，评估所提实验设计。"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:179 2690e9f97bf54e8db1fe6838ada6a1a5
msgid ""
"``hypothesis`` (string) (required) A clear statement of the research "
"hypothesis to be tested."
msgstr "``hypothesis``（字符串）（必填）需明确陈述待检验的研究假设。"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:182 6d14ffe088ec416d8f974904dc16675e
msgid ""
"``design_description`` (string) (required) A detailed description of the "
"proposed experimental design, including variables, methods, sample "
"details, and planned analyses."
msgstr "``design_description``（字符串）（必填） 对拟议实验设计的详细描述，包括变量、方法、样本详情及计划的分析内容。"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:200 a6fe45770bfb46838c3f82aa8d735b64
msgid "**HypothesisGenerator** (Type: AgenticTool)"
msgstr "**HypothesisGenerator**（类型：AgenticTool）"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:202 f400798427e64694ab5b90878e93843c
msgid ""
"Generates research hypotheses based on provided background context, "
"domain, and desired format. U..."
msgstr "根据提供的背景信息、领域和所需格式生成研究假设。U..."

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst d0f1e6a99f8b4e15a502e8ddcf11a3c0
msgid "HypothesisGenerator tool specification"
msgstr "HypothesisGenerator 工具规格说明"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:208 aa40887a678645b1b2955d1420dd4e4e
msgid "**Name**: ``HypothesisGenerator``"
msgstr "**名称**：``HypothesisGenerator``"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:210 0526165e171d4bc49a5636e7cee7b62b
msgid ""
"**Description**: Generates research hypotheses based on provided "
"background context, domain, and desired format. Uses AI to propose novel,"
" testable hypotheses for scientific exploration."
msgstr "**描述**：基于提供的背景信息、领域和所需格式生成研究假设。利用人工智能提出新颖且可验证的假设，支持科学探索。"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:214 94357a01780040e889f194950787164e
msgid ""
"``context`` (string) (required) Background information, observations, or "
"data description from which to derive hypotheses."
msgstr "``context``（字符串）（必填）用于推导假设的背景信息、观察结果或数据描述。"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:217 0007fd10b3914ea382595b8e1758a7ed
msgid ""
"``domain`` (string) (required) Field of study or research area (e.g., "
"'neuroscience', 'ecology', 'materials science')."
msgstr "``domain``（字符串）（必填）研究领域或学科方向（例如，“神经科学”、“生态学”、“材料科学”）。"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:220 f8127ff82c9a486bbadacf206f576b6e
msgid ""
"``number_of_hypotheses`` (string) (required) Number of hypotheses to "
"generate (e.g., '3', '5')."
msgstr "``number_of_hypotheses``（字符串）（必填）生成假设的数量（例如，“3”，“5”）。"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:223 939439c064524a35a019f65d2af44d46
msgid ""
"``hypothesis_format`` (string) (optional) Optional directive on how to "
"structure each hypothesis. Choose from one of the following formats:"
msgstr "``hypothesis_format``（字符串）（可选） 可选指令，用于指定每个假设的结构。可从以下格式中选择一种："

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:226 df30f0c11cf749c48d81c6ab4563bb99
msgid ""
"If–Then Statements: \"If [independent variable condition], then [expected"
" outcome].\""
msgstr "条件语句：“如果[自变量条件]，那么[预期结果]。”"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:227 cc7c35b4098d44d895d1bdcc686f2314
msgid ""
"Null and Alternative (Statistical): • H₀ (Null): \"There is no "
"difference/effect/association between X and Y.\" • H₁ (Alt): \"There is a"
" difference/effect/association between X and Y.\""
msgstr ""
"零假设与备择假设（统计学）：  \n"
"• H₀（零假设）：“X 与 Y 之间不存在差异/效应/关联。”  \n"
"• H₁（备择假设）：“X 与 Y 之间存在差异/效应/关联。”"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:230 0e19567d0c034c0581e795af154a4b06
msgid ""
"Associative (Correlation-Focused): \"There is a relationship/association "
