" to [directional change] in [Variable B].\""
msgstr "方向性（非条件式）：“增加/减少[变量A]将导致[变量B]的[方向性变化]。”"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:232 aef32fa287434e87a25f278fc34f32c4
msgid ""
"Comparative (Group Comparison): \"Group A will show higher/lower "
