msgstr "比较（组间比较）：“在[条件]下，A组的[因变量]将高于/低于B组。”"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:233 48b088437b014e05bc05d29ecc09908d
msgid ""
"Mechanistic: \"Because [mechanism or process], [Variable A] will cause "
