msgstr "机械性：“由于[机制或过程]，[变量A]将导致[变量B]。”"

#: ../../tools/agentic_tools.rst:234 9d9dd190d5524c4493e26b6e035c94ff
msgid ""
"Descriptive (Exploratory/Pattern-Oriented): \"Population X exhibits "
